WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.279 --> 00:00:01.583
- When you're thinking about trying

00:00:01.583 --> 00:00:04.425
to pluck your eyebrows super thin, don't.

00:00:04.425 --> 00:00:07.524
'Cause like, we looked
gnarly during that time.

00:00:07.524 --> 00:00:10.024
(perky music)

00:00:11.437 --> 00:00:13.300
- Hi, come on in.

00:00:13.300 --> 00:00:14.133
- [Man in Black Hat] How's it going?

00:00:14.133 --> 00:00:15.124
- [Woman interviewing]
Good, how are you doing?

00:00:15.124 --> 00:00:15.957
- Good.

00:00:15.957 --> 00:00:18.338
- Awesome, you hit your mark perfectly.

00:00:18.338 --> 00:00:19.929
So I want you to close your eyes.

00:00:19.929 --> 00:00:20.922
We're gonna go back in time.

00:00:20.922 --> 00:00:22.274
Once you feel like you're ready,

00:00:22.274 --> 00:00:23.841
I want you to open your eyes,

00:00:23.841 --> 00:00:26.364
say whatever comes to your mind first.

00:00:26.364 --> 00:00:28.362
- [Voiceover] Do you wanna
talk to your younger self?

00:00:28.362 --> 00:00:29.195
- Should I?

00:00:29.195 --> 00:00:30.304
- [Voiceover] Yeah.

00:00:30.304 --> 00:00:31.732
- All right.

00:00:31.732 --> 00:00:32.732
Let's do it.

00:00:37.792 --> 00:00:39.875
(laughs)

00:00:40.766 --> 00:00:43.099
- How are you brave little--

00:00:44.107 --> 00:00:45.649
- I'm sorry.

00:00:45.649 --> 00:00:49.506
- I'm sorry that you feel
so alone and isolated.

00:00:49.506 --> 00:00:50.959
- I know you're scared right now

00:00:50.959 --> 00:00:53.767
because you don't know
exactly what's going on.

00:00:53.767 --> 00:00:56.529
- People around you, they just
don't understand right now.

00:00:56.529 --> 00:00:58.906
- We want to play with these toys,

00:00:58.906 --> 00:01:01.408
they want you to play with the other toys.

00:01:01.408 --> 00:01:04.245
- They don't see you right
now the way you see yourself.

00:01:04.245 --> 00:01:06.972
- You didn't have anything to worry about.

00:01:06.972 --> 00:01:10.472
- You're not crazy, you
are who you say you are.

00:01:10.472 --> 00:01:12.504
You are one of the boys.

00:01:12.504 --> 00:01:14.819
- I remember every night you would wish

00:01:14.819 --> 00:01:18.986
that one day you'd grow up
to be this beautiful woman.

00:01:20.373 --> 00:01:24.140
- You really are as
beautiful as you thought

00:01:24.140 --> 00:01:27.125
that you might be, or
that some people told you.

00:01:27.125 --> 00:01:31.075
- You are going to be wonder
woman when you grow up.

00:01:31.075 --> 00:01:33.678
- You're gonna be okay.

00:01:33.678 --> 00:01:36.544
The future is bumpy and you think things

00:01:36.544 --> 00:01:38.127
are going slow now.

00:01:39.038 --> 00:01:43.276
- The world becomes a much
easier place for people like you.

00:01:43.276 --> 00:01:45.280
- There will be doctors who will help you

00:01:45.280 --> 00:01:48.197
and understand you and other people

00:01:49.123 --> 00:01:53.290
that feel just like you do
and you'll be part of it.

00:01:54.358 --> 00:01:56.438
'Cause you're still gonna be here.

00:01:56.438 --> 00:01:58.016
- You will live in a bigger city,

00:01:58.016 --> 00:01:59.981
find other people that you relate to.

00:01:59.981 --> 00:02:01.658
- They're gonna love you so much.

00:02:01.658 --> 00:02:04.332
They're gonna give you so much support.

00:02:04.332 --> 00:02:07.033
- You have to be patient
because the future

00:02:07.033 --> 00:02:08.794
is where you can be free.

00:02:08.794 --> 00:02:10.421
You just gotta keep going.

00:02:10.421 --> 00:02:12.648
- When you see that first Whoopi Goldberg

00:02:12.648 --> 00:02:17.108
special on HBO, think to
yourself you can do that.

00:02:17.116 --> 00:02:19.268
You can get paid to make people laugh.

00:02:19.268 --> 00:02:23.351
- Your life is no less
worthy than anyone else's.

00:02:25.729 --> 00:02:29.219
Because you're trans,
you are extra special.

00:02:29.219 --> 00:02:31.379
- The world is so big
and there are so many

00:02:31.379 --> 00:02:33.455
people who are going
through the exact same thing

00:02:33.455 --> 00:02:34.922
as you because there's a future

00:02:34.922 --> 00:02:38.901
that waits for you that's
far less small and scary

00:02:38.901 --> 00:02:42.037
than your junior high or
your high school experience.

00:02:42.037 --> 00:02:44.693
- I don't want to give
away too much to you.

00:02:44.693 --> 00:02:45.917
You're gonna have an awesome life

00:02:45.917 --> 00:02:48.884
but always, always try to love your body

00:02:48.884 --> 00:02:50.870
and always try to love yourself because

00:02:50.870 --> 00:02:53.227
that's the most important thing.

00:02:53.227 --> 00:02:54.701
And I love you.

00:02:54.701 --> 00:02:55.784
- I love you.

00:02:56.641 --> 00:02:58.184
Bye, cutie.

00:02:58.184 --> 00:03:01.934
Going back to the future,
see you there, bye.

